  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-27T20:52:35.906Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be very helpful to have access to OnPreRender and OnPostRender events in Udon for the VRChat Camera/Drone, so we can manipulate the scene at those specific stages of the rendering. \n\nFor example, in my worlds Jetski Islet and Jetski Rush, I would like to move the water mesh to follow the drone camera during OnPreRender and reset it during OnPostRender to the player position. This would allow for high-detail water rendering for both the player view and the external drone/camera view.",
